# Fastbond (CR 305.2, 603.4): "You may play any number of lands on each of your turns. Whenever you play a land, if it
# wasn't the first land you played this turn, this enchantment deals 1 damage to you." Bot1 plays a Forest, casts
# Fastbond with it, then plays two more lands in the same turn. The first land cost nothing; each of the two after it
# dealt 1 damage, so Bot1 is at 18.

